 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=f_VEVSHy8aoQ7kNvwH8jEVX&_nc_oc=AdqVxqKjr7aISsaTwSojeagmH_9R0fxHUiLtW-f5OSZmpRfkeDz3sgpEWXOFGvKiKpU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNrvgkIO4Y00jiCs2YNG9vBNKGApE6zs-h7QAc13mI7Ag&oe=6AC11CC1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=buNg3GcfYPMQ7kNvwEHv-J-&_nc_oc=AdoaBlwtppgOGyHLgA_My8fLmQIdIqMqymagDKZpN0fUJp4D_vnR29A6AIxlemsZfKI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNm9UxXIAltHmLTy0rZE03TIL0lyTdO7miGZM2Ctf3_AQ&oe=6AC12A26"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i8E6JrErcq4Q7kNvwHg1xYz&_nc_oc=Adp-MBSRRSBj2mMKiQQineSBdwP1wSiN2__YLzM77vMNr4ZrIA54CJpFPWi8iRcAVRg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP9zwb78Ns4D5BnBMfdyYcL-cW90cH2ENTFc8W8zLHhtg&oe=6AC1341C"}, {"fil